FindChildModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Returns the first direct child node of node named name (via the children list), or null if absent. AST navigation utility.
    Provides: FindChild(node, name) -> found.
    DependsOn: none (leaf in module dependencies)
    Composition: Native Include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../FindChild/FindChild.sir).
